{
  "description": "Catalog addresses on which the runner's endpoint policy (crates/infra-lake/src/policy.rs) and the host's check (runners/lake/sagat_lake/connection.py, _url with loopback_http) must AGREE. Each side has its own test that reads this file, so a change to one parser that the other does not follow fails a test. Cases where one side is stricter on purpose are listed in that side's own test, not here.",
  "accept": [
    "https://catalog.example",
    "https://catalog.example/api/v1",
    "https://catalog.example:8443/",
